# Custom environment variables & secrets for this app.
#
# Substrait reads this file on upload and PRE-CREATES each entry under the app's
# Settings, so the owner just fills in real values in the portal.
#
#   NAME=value            -> an environment variable, prefilled with `value`
#   NAME=value   # secret -> a secret (write-only; masked in the portal)
#
# Do NOT list DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET or backing-service vars — the platform
# injects those. Read these at runtime with os.getenv; never commit real secrets.
# Re-uploading only adds new keys; it never overwrites values set in the portal.

# Title shown in the app header. Change it per installation if you like.
APP_TITLE=Cardiac Care Tips